{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左上から、\nポロショコラ 弘前\n朝の八甲田\nやっこいサブレ\nいのち\nりんごスティック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝の八甲田は\nきいちゃんのご家族からだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズケーキなんだけど\nとてつもなく美味しかった！！\n本当にオヌヌメです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで\n昨日は\nアンダーライブ全国ツアー\n青森公演でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもと違う髪型しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもは左サイドねじり、ストレート\n昨日は両方ねじり、巻き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざっくり言うと\nいつものがかっこいい系で\nそれよりは可愛いよりです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にもやったことあるけど久々ですね\nレア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青森に来てくれた人だけ特別"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれて\nありがとうございました( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演中にも言いましたが\n『BRODY』発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はね\n外で撮る予定だったんだけど\n雨が降ってしまいました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"降らせてしまいました\nが正しいのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず\nメンバーたくさん載ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！Bicycle"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の沈金は真夏に託しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴けてないから\n聴いてたみなさん、\n盛り上がってたところ教えて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/23/8160438/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}